/*generated_code/*
/blockset_*
/slprj/*
/builds/*
# MEX files: the Windows builds (.mexw64) are in the repository, so the blockset works
# without a host C compiler. They include gocontroll_mex_version.mexw64, which holds the
# blockset version: after a version change run compile_gocontroll_mex('force') and commit
# all .mexw64 files. Other platforms compile their own when the library is first loaded.
/blockset/blocks/**/*.mexa64
/blockset/blocks/**/*.mexmaci64
/blockset/blocks/**/*.mexmaca64
~*
*.slx.autosave
*.map
!GOcontroll_Simulink_version.m
*.zip
crank_files/
*.slxc
*.autosave
*.mltbx
.vscode/*
!.vscode/*shared.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
/build/
